grations to run on your account instead of included credits.']::text[],array['OpenAI','Anthropic','Google Gemini']::text[],true,'AI Product Description Generator — €19 | AgentForge AI','Generate on-brand product copy, benefit bullets and SEO meta tags from product attributes.',array['ai product description generator','e-commerce','attribute-grounded copy with no invented claims','tone presets for premium, friendly or technical brands']::text[],'2026-11-19') on conflict (id) do update set title=excluded.title, short_description=excluded.short_description, description=excluded.description, updated_at=now();
